flowchart TD
  browser[Browser] --> authRouter[/auth router/]
  browser --> guard{checkAuthMiddleware}
  authRouter --> login{POST /auth/login}
  login -->|empty or wrong| login401[401 Invalid password]
  login -->|correct| issue[Issue token and cookie]
  authRouter --> init{GET /auth/init}
  init -->|valid cookie| rotate[Rotate token and cookie]
  init -->|invalid| clear[Clear token and cookie]
  guard -->|password mode off| open[Allow request]
  guard -->|no or invalid cookie| guard401[401 No/invalid JWT]
  guard -->|valid| api[/api router/]
